---
description: Data contract discipline
alwaysApply: true
---

## Contract rules
- Schema versioning: never silently rename or drop fields.
- Boundary validation: runtime schemas at API edges.
- If upstream shape changes: map -> canonical; add fixture + contract test.

## UI rules
- No blank screens. Always render loading/error/degraded state.
- Degraded payload must include reason + lastUpdated.
